{"info":{"name":"BMA-50 채팅방 목록 API (S6)","description":"S6 채팅방 목록 API 검증 컬렉션.\n\n두 계정을 매칭시켜 채팅방을 만든 뒤 목록(상대 마스킹·마지막 메시지·안읽음), 안읽음 합계(사이드바 배지), 읽음 처리, 나가기(S6-11, 재입장), 매칭 종료 후 ENDED(S6-12, 읽기 전용) 흐름을 검증한다.\nRunner 로 위에서부터 순서대로 실행해야 한다(앞 요청이 만든 토큰·ID를 뒤에서 쓴다).\n\n사전 조건\n- docker compose up -d --build\n\n검증 항목: status ACTIVE/ENDED, 마스킹(닉네임 null·시/도), 미리보기 50자, 안읽음 규칙(본인 메시지 제외·ENDED 0·합계 일치), 나가기/재입장, 읽기 전용 409, 권한 403, 빈 상태.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. 사용자 A 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// 매 실행마다 새 계정과 새 닉네임을 쓴다. 반복 실행해도 깨지지 않게 한다.","const t = Date.now();","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailA\", \"chat-a-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailB\", \"chat-b-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailC\", \"chat-c-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickA\", \"채팅A\" + (t % 100000));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickB\", \"채팅B\" + (t % 100000));"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userA\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"2. 로그인 A","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"3. 프로필 A (서울 강남, M, ENFP)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"nickname\":\"{{nickA}}\",\"birthDate\":\"1995-05-05\",\"genderCode\":\"M\",\"regionCode\":\"SEOUL_GANGNAM\",\"mbtiCode\":\"ENFP\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"4. 사용자 B 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userB\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailB}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"5. 로그인 B","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenB\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailB}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"6. 프로필 B (서울 중구, F, INFP)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"nickname\":\"{{nickB}}\",\"birthDate\":\"1997-07-07\",\"genderCode\":\"F\",\"regionCode\":\"SEOUL_JUNG\",\"mbtiCode\":\"INFP\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"7. A → B 좋아요","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"targetUserId\":{{userB}},\"actionType\":\"LIKE\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/actions","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","actions"]}}},{"name":"8. B → A 좋아요 → 매칭·채팅방 생성","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"matched=true, chatRoomId\", () => { pm.expect(d.matched).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.chatRoomId).to.be.a(\"number\"); });","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"matchId\", d.matchId); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"roomId\", d.chatRoomId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"targetUserId\":{{userA}},\"actionType\":\"LIKE\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/actions","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","actions"]}}},{"name":"9. A 목록 - 방 1개, ACTIVE, 상대 마스킹(???), 메시지 없음","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","const r = d[0];","pm.test(\"1개, roomId 일치, status=ACTIVE\", () => { pm.expect(d).to.have.lengthOf(1); pm.expect(r.chatRoomId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"roomId\")); pm.expect(r.status).to.eql(\"ACTIVE\"); });","pm.test(\"partner: nickname null, 서울특별시, INFP\", () => { pm.expect(r.partner).to.have.property(\"nickname\", null); pm.expect(r.partner.regionName).to.eql(\"서울특별시\"); pm.expect(r.partner.mbtiCode).to.eql(\"INFP\"); });","pm.test(\"lastMessage null 키 존재, unreadCount 0\", () => { pm.expect(r).to.have.property(\"lastMessage\", null); pm.expect(r.unreadCount).to.eql(0); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms"]}}},{"name":"10. A 안읽음 합계 - 0","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"unreadCount=0\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.unreadCount).to.eql(0));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/unread-count","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms","unread-count"]}}},{"name":"11. B 메시지 전송 1 (REST)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"messageType\":\"TEXT\",\"content\":\"안녕하세요 반가워요\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms","{{roomId}}","messages"]}}},{"name":"12. B 메시지 전송 2 (REST)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"messageId, chatRoomId\", () => { pm.expect(d.messageId).to.be.a(\"number\"); pm.expect(d.chatRoomId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"roomId\")); });","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"msg2Id\", d.messageId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"messageType\":\"TEXT\",\"content\":\"오늘 저녁에 시간 괜찮으세요?\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms","{{roomId}}","messages"]}}},{"name":"13. A 목록 - unread 2, 마지막 메시지 미리보기·시간","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","const r = d[0];","pm.test(\"unreadCount=2, 미리보기, TEXT, 시각\", () => { pm.expect(r.unreadCount).to.eql(2); pm.expect(r.lastMessage).to.eql(\"오늘 저녁에 시간 괜찮으세요?\"); pm.expect(r.lastMessageType).to.eql(\"TEXT\"); pm.expect(r.lastMessageDate).to.be.a(\"string\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms"]}}},{"name":"14. A 안읽음 합계 = 목록 합 (2)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"unreadCount=2\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.unreadCount).to.eql(2));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/unread-count","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms","unread-count"]}}},{"name":"15. B 목록 - 본인 메시지는 안읽음 아님","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"unreadCount=0, partner ENFP\", () => { pm.expect(d[0].unreadCount).to.eql(0); pm.expect(d[0].partner.mbtiCode).to.eql(\"ENFP\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms"]}}},{"name":"16. A 읽음 처리","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/{{roomId}}/read?messageId={{msg2Id}}","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms","{{roomId}}","read"],"query":[{"key":"messageId","value":"{{msg2Id}}"}]}}},{"name":"17. A 안읽음 합계 - 0","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"unreadCount=0\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.unreadCount).to.eql(0));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/unread-count","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms","unread-count"]}}},{"name":"18. A 긴 메시지(60자) 전송","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"messageType\":\"TEXT\",\"content\":\"가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가가\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms","{{roomId}}","messages"]}}},{"name":"19. B 목록 - 미리보기 50자 + ...","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"unread 1, 미리보기 ... 로 끝나고 53자 이하\", () => { pm.expect(d[0].unreadCount).to.eql(1); pm.expect(d[0].lastMessage).to.match(/\\.\\.\\.$/); pm.expect(d[0].lastMessage.length).to.be.at.most(53); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms"]}}},{"name":"20. 인증 없이 목록 (401)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms"]}}},{"name":"21. 사용자 C 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailC}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"22. 로그인 C","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenC\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailC}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"23. C 목록 - 빈 배열 (S6-10 빈 상태)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"data=[]\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.eql([]));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenC}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms"]}}},{"name":"24. C 가 남의 방 나가기 (403)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 403 CHAT_002\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(403); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"CHAT_002\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenC}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/{{roomId}}","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms","{{roomId}}"]}}},{"name":"25. C 가 남의 방에 전송 (403)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 403 CHAT_002\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(403); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"CHAT_002\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenC}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"messageType\":\"TEXT\",\"content\":\"끼어들기\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","chat","rooms","{{roomId}}","messages"]}}},{"name":"26. A 나가기 (S6-11)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/rooms/{{roomId}}","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path"